with the timeout mechanism in the browser automation gateway (`D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision\\app.py`) and matching pipeline:\n  Because we upgraded the extraction schema to the detailed 5-field structure (`item_name_raw`, `trade_name`, `strength`, `form`, `source_page`), Gemini takes longer to think and stream tokens into the DOM.\n  The server previously had arbitrary fixed \"timeout zones\" (`stagnation_timeout`, `first_token_timeout`) that prematurely aborted generation or declared false completion.\n  **The User's Required Solution**:\n  1. **UI Button Triggers**:\n     - When a prompt is submitted, the Run/Submit button transforms into the **\"Cancel generation\"** button (Stop icon with `mat-tooltip=\"Cancel generation\"` or `aria-label=\"Cancel generation\"`).\n     - **Check 1 (Trigger 1)**: As long as the button is in the **Cancel generation** state (or thinking spinner is active), the model is actively thinking/generating. **NEVER TIMEOUT! DO NOT ABORT!** Yield streaming deltas as characters grow in the DOM.\n     - When the button changes to **disabled** (`aria-disabled=\"true\"` or native disabled, which Google AI Studio does once generation finishes because the prompt textarea is empty), that is the unequivocal trigger that generation has ended.\n  2. **Response Structure Validation (Check 2)**:\n     - After generation stops via the button trigger, validate the response (e.g. check if the JSON parses, contains `\"items\"`, or has the expected count of cases).\n     - If the response is valid -> Success.\n     - If the response is malformed, truncated, or failed -> Mark as failure/trigger retry. Never blame arbitrary timeout seconds.\n  3. **No Premature Timeouts**:\n     - Timeouts should only exist as a massive safety net (e.g. 15-20 minutes / 1200s) to catch a completely frozen browser or crashed tab, NOT to interrupt active generation.\n     - This applies to both vision extraction (`src/extract/gemini_vision_extractor.py`) and matching (`src/fast_match/coordinator.py`).\n\n---\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed:\n1. **Desktop App UI Fixes** (from previous turn):\n   - In `desktop_app/templates/index.html`: Fixed `.main-content` and `.screen` CSS (`min-height: 0; flex: 1; overflow-y: auto;`).\n   - Resolved start matching button clipping completely; compacted headers, drop zones, and action bar so the button is centered and fully visible on all screen sizes.\n   - Scoped `#progress-modal` to `position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: var(--radius-xl); z-index: 500` inside `#screen-new`, leaving the Sidebar Menu (`.sidebar`, `z-index: 10`) 100% accessible and interactive during matching.\n   - Wired automatic redirection to `screen-results` upon match completion.\n   - Synced to `dist_production`.\n2. **Analysis of Gateway Timeout Bottlenecks**:\n   - In `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision\\app.py`:\n     - Identified lines 444-488 (`get_adaptive_timeouts` had `initial_start_timeout: 60s`, `first_token_timeout: 90s-240s`, `stagnation_timeout: 60s-120s`).\n     - In line 699: `stopBtn` only checked `\"stop\"`, `\"stop run\"`, `\"cancel run\"` and missed `mattooltip=\"Cancel generation\"`, causing false completion detection after 3s of stability!\n     - In `send_prompt_and_stream` (lines 880-955): Arbitrary timeouts were killing the stream while the model was still generating.\n   - In `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision\\src\\extract\\gemini_vision_extractor.py`:\n     - Line 238 had `requests.post(..., timeout=240)`.\n   - In `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision\\src\\fast_match\\coordinator.py`:\n     - Line 654 had `read_timeout = max(300, ...)`.\n     - Line 556 aborted immediately on `STAGNATION_TIMEOUT`.\n\n3. **Code Changes Started in `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision\\app.py`**:\n   - Updated `get_adaptive_timeouts` to trigger-based configuration (`initial_start_timeout: 180s`, `stability_duration: 1.0s`, `hard_ceiling: 1200s`).\n\n---\n\n## 3. Key Findings & Design Decisions\n- **Google AI Studio UI States**:\n  - Idle/Ready: Button is Active (`button.ctrl-enter`, `aria-disabled=\"false\"`).\n  - Generating: Button has Stop icon and tooltip `Cancel generation` (`mat-tooltip=\"Cancel generation\"` or `aria-label=\"Cancel generation\"`), enabled so the user can cancel.\n  - Finished: Prompt textarea is empty, so AI Studio sets the button to `disabled` (`aria-disabled=\"true\"` or native `disabled`).\n  - Active Spinners: `mat-progress-spinner`, `ms-spinner`, `.thought-activity-host[aria-expanded=\"true\"]`.\n- **Eliminating Stagnation/First-Token Timeouts**:\n  - As long as `is_running` is True (button is \"Cancel generation\" or spinner active), the stream MUST NOT abort.\n  - When `is_running` becomes False, wait 1.0s for the DOM to settle, then declare `RESPONSE_COMPLETED`.\n  - Validate response format in Python (Check 2).\n\n---\n\n## 4. Active Context\n- **Target Files to Update**:\n  1. `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision\\app.py`:\n     - Replace `js_fetch_state` (around line 666) to detect `cancel_generation` button and disabled state.\n     - Replace `send_prompt_and_stream` loop (around lines 820-940) with pure trigger logic (no stagnation timeout, finish when button transitions out of Cancel generation).\n  2. `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision\\src\\extract\\gemini_vision_extractor.py`:\n     - Increase HTTP timeout on line 238 from `240` to `900`.\n     - Ensure structure validation error raises cleanly for retry.\n  3. `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision\\src\\fast_match\\coordinator.py`:\n     - Increase HTTP `read_timeout` on line 654 to `max(900, case_count * 15 + 300)`.\n     - In lines 556-558, remove the hard abort on `STAGNATION_TIMEOUT` so retries can occur if a transient issue arises.\n  4. Sync changes to `dist_production`.\n\n- **Environment**:\n  - Python: `D:\\miniconda3\\envs\\venv\\python.exe`.\n  - Ports: 8000 and 8001 free.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Next Steps\n1. **Apply `js_fetch_state` and Stream Loop edits in `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision\\app.py`**:\n   - In `js_fetch_state`: Inspect all buttons for `aria-label`, `mattooltip`, `title`, or icons with `cancel generation`/`stop`, and check `runControlBtn` disabled state. Return `button_state` and `is_running`.\n   - In streaming loop:\n     - Log button state transitions (`[TRIGGER] Button State -> cancel_generation / disabled`).\n     - Never timeout while `is_running` is True.\n     - When `is_running` turns False, wait `stability_duration` (1.0s), transition to `RESPONSE_COMPLETED`, and break.\n2. **Update Client Timeouts and Validation**:\n   - In `src/extract/gemini_vision_extractor.py`: Change `timeout=240` to `timeout=900`.\n   - In `src/fast_match/coordinator.py`: Increase `read_timeout` to `max(900, ...)`.\n3. **Sync to `dist_production`**:\n   - Run `python scratch/sync_dist.py`.\n4. **Syntax & Verification Check**:\n   - Run `scratch/check_syntax.py`.\n5. **Report to User**:\n   - Explain how the 2-step trigger system is implemented exactly as requested (Button trigger: Cancel generation -> disabled; followed by response structure validation check).\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 389 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.agents/agents/desktop-builder/agent.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T22:17:02Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.agents/agents/pharmacy-builder/agent.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T10:46:04Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790101953275]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.tempmediaStorage/media_1790101953275.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-22T18:32:33Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790262999556]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.tempmediaStorage/media_1790262999556.png\nLast Edited: 